    "HeartSync compares consumer-device measurements and does not establish medical accuracy. Neither device is treated as a reference standard, and this analysis does not determine which device is correct." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer for the HeartSync app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "HeartSync has not started Bluetooth, HealthKit, or Oura. Your existing files have not been overwritten. Unlock the device or resolve storage access, then retry.\n\n%@" : {

    },
    "HeartSync is not a medical device. It reads consumer wearables and shows you what they say. Nothing here is a diagnosis, and none of it should be used to make a medical decision. If a reading worries you, talk to a clinician." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer that explains that HeartSync is not a medical device and that it should not be used to make a medical diagnosis.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "HeartSync uses median values in epoch-aligned windows and excludes estimates. Ready analyses use mean bias and 95% limits of agreement; insufficient overlap is never treated as agreement." : {
