      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Take a reading with a validated blood pressure cuff, sitting still, and enter it here along with wearing your sensor. HeartSync records your heart rate and HRV at this moment as the reference point." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the blood pressure calibration process.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The blood pressure index in this app is a trend indicator anchored to a cuff reading you enter, clamped to a narrow band, and shown with a wide interval. It will not detect hypertension and will not tell you your blood pressure has changed. Use a validated cuff." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer for the blood pressure section of the disclaimer.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The Client ID identifies your OAuth application and is not secret. Do not enter or embed the Client Secret; HeartSync's client-side OAuth flow does not use it." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Client ID and Client Secret.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The export contains only this metric, source pair, and selected range. When evidence is insufficient, the summary explicitly withholds an agreement conclusion." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the contents of the export.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The horizontal position is the mean of the two device values. The vertical position is A minus B. Limits of agreement describe these observations; they are not inferential confidence intervals." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Bland-Altman plot.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The index is expressed relative to these values. It expires after 30 days, because a month-old anchor is no longer informative." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer that explains the disclaimer for the blood pressure estimate.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "The shaded band spans the highest and lowest device reading in each %@ window. A wide band means your devices disagree at that moment." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the band in the chart.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "This build treats Oura as an advanced optional integration for personal/developer use. Bluetooth and Apple Health remain fully usable without it. HeartSync does not ship a shared production Oura client identity, so setup requires your own Oura OAuth application." : {

